        "official_en_sha256": "fa3c0cf7cf1805bc0e214898e83b8148ecc8678f4b4248705ed26c0dd12891d3"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水の巫女として、\r\n大勢の人に奉仕するのではなく……。",
        "official_en": "I long for a life in which, rather than serving the people as a Water Maiden...",
        "real_en": "Rather than serving so many people as a Water Maiden..."
