      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水神様のいるドール湖は神聖な場所ですから\r\n簡単には立ち入りできないようになっているのです。",
        "official_en": "Lake Dorr is the sacred domain of the God of Water. So as you can see, we’ve taken the necessary measures to ensure people cannot just come and go as they please.",
        "real_en": "Lake Dorr is sacred, home to the God of Water.\r\nThat’s why access is restricted."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
